      "writtenOn": "2019-08-16T08:09:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, max_spare is per-pd, while highest_spare is per-rd, basically. It\u0027s definitely possible to re-use the same variable for both, but I found the code to be even less readable that way as you need to check prefer_idle in even more places. And that\u0027s also what we have in 4.19, so I just kept that as-is for consistency.",
      "parentUuid": "ce53b452_c09a2f9f",
      "revId": "4b4f1a7f2b905ac93a5c4bfdc0bf4787c38c6ec2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
